    "created_at": "2023-04-28T15:51:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-28T15:51:55Z",
    "body": "> @nt1m if I'm reading [WebKit/WebKit#11155](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/11155) correctly, you implemented this behavior in `FullscreenManager.cpp`, but I'm unsure if all of the `isInPopoverShowingState()` checks are intended to always pass, or if there are also cases where a fullscreen request will be rejected because of an open popover?\r\n\r\nI think our implementation matches this PR, the `isInPopoverShowingState()` checks are for the \"fullscreen element ready check\". We could probably refactor to make this more clear, but that's how things are currently setup.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
